  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "As each [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) starts, you may choose one of the 2 imperatives below. Until that round ends it applies to your army, and every unit of yours with this ability gains its effects.\n\n**PROTECTOR IMPERATIVE** gives the unit:\n\n- **[[HEAVY]](vsdata:weapon-ability/heavy)** on its ranged weapons.\n- Ballistic Skill of its ranged weapons improved by 1.\n- −1 to the **Hit rolls** of melee attacks aimed at it, while it is **BATTLELINE** itself or has another **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit of yours no more than 6\" away.\n\n**CONQUEROR IMPERATIVE** gives the unit:\n\n- **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** on its ranged weapons.\n- Weapon Skill of its melee weapons improved by 1.\n- Armour Penetration improved by 1 on each attack its models make, under that same **BATTLELINE** condition.",
